## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Ubermoc UI
## Notes: Play World of Warcraft with just a controller, no mouse or keyboard needed. Radial menus, a pointer for every window, controller-friendly dialogue, round unit frames and a minimal interface that fades out of the way.
